-- WHOSE with no cast: there is no constructor to take the fields from, so the
-- checker asks for the cast or for WHO (§13.6, RULED 2026-09-21).
IMPORT prelude

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Tenant HAS tname IS A STRING
               arrears IS A NUMBER
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Pay HAS payer IS AN Actor

alice MEANS Tenant WITH tname IS "Alice", arrears IS 1200
everyone MEANS LIST alice

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`no cast to read fields from` MEANS
    EVERY t IN everyone
        WHOSE  arrears AT LEAST 1000
        MUST   Pay t
        WITHIN 7
        UPON EACH
        HENCE  FULFILLED
        LEST   BREACH
